# Managed by kriegerdataforge-cicd (distribute_scripts.py, ADR D-013).
# Declares the Python toolchain that operates on the vendored scripts/kdf_scripts/
# copies. The scripts themselves are stdlib-only and need nothing to RUN.
#
# kdf-fmt tracks main (cicd D-054), and this line is its one declaration. The
# reusable style lane reads its ref from here, and `make ci-style` reinstalls from
# it before each check, so the local check and CI run the same formatter.
kdf-fmt @ git+https://github.com/Needless2Say/kriegerdataforge-fmt.git@main
